<title>BULGARIA: WEATHER FORECAST - BULGARIA - JUNE 27 - HOT.</title>
<headline>WEATHER FORECAST - BULGARIA - JUNE 27 - HOT.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sunny and hot across the country, state radio said.</p>
<p>Maximum temperatures are expected between 27 and 32 degrees, temperature in Sofia is seen at about 27 degrees.</p>
<p>Air temperatures along the Black Sea coast expected between 24 and 27 degrees, sea water temperature seen at 22-24 degrees. -- Sofia Newsroom, 359-2-91188</p>
